# Copy this file to auth.env (same directory) and fill in ONE of the two
# credentials below. Never commit the real auth.env — it's gitignored.
# See docs/authentication.md for how to generate each.

# Preferred: a long-lived OAuth token bound to your Claude subscription.
# Generate on a trusted machine (NOT the target machine) with:
#   claude setup-token
# CLAUDE_CODE_OAUTH_TOKEN=

# Fallback: an Anthropic Console API key (metered billing, not your
# subscription). Only set this if you deliberately want per-repair usage
# isolated to a Console key instead of your subscription.
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
